          "   2           6         26                  4              0.88  turning                  Am Plärrer                11.06609  49.44796",
          "   3           5         21                  5              0.86  driving                  Neutorgraben              11.07124  49.45676",
          "   4           3         20                  1              1.00  turning into / crossing  Äußere Bayreuther Straße  11.10338  49.47288",
          "   5           0         17                  3              1.00  driving                  Von-der-Tann-Straße       11.03592  49.44077",
